From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 03:12:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Scope catalog cache by provider and refresh a stale snapshot
 once.

Parent a3bd6d0. The OpenRouter file is not attributed to Nara. A fresh cache is not refetched. A stale cache with a transport performs one bounded GET; a failed GET keeps the original timestamp and stays stale. Price units are per component. A readCache failure closes without a fetch. chooseModel does not call the catalog read.
